   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "G1  no TLA+ model of the fuse envelope (admitted, conditional on the refinement obligation)\nG2  no mechanised refinement from the Lean machines to src/replica/* \u2014 the era guard arithmetic\n     is pinned in Lean (Fuse.same_ballot_era_guard) while the guard lives in normal.rs\nG3  mid-wire-phase crash of the bumped identity (shadow S1) \u2014 no test until the marker ruling lands\nG4  promotion-gating of a standby (shadow S6) \u2014 which property learner_acquisition.rs actually pins\nG5  maelstrom kill-nemesis on the diskless profile \u2014 verify reincarnation is exercised end-to-end",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "baseline": 11,
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "G1  no TLA+ model of the fuse envelope (admitted, conditional on the refinement obligation)\nG2  no mechanised refinement from the Lean machines to src/replica/* \u2014 the era guard arithmetic\n     is pinned in Lean (Fuse.same_ballot_era_guard) while the guard lives in normal.rs\nG3  mid-wire-phase crash of the bumped identity (shadow S1) \u2014 no test until the marker ruling lands\nG4  promotion-gating of a standby (shadow S6) \u2014 which property learner_acquisition.rs actually pins\nG5  maelstrom kill-nemesis on the diskless profile \u2014 verify reincarnation is exercised end-to-end",
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  }
